  "details": "1. Find [CosmoLuv Avatar World](https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_7f7d4d81-62a5-403d-a648-0a6b38710f26/info) (wrld_7f7d4d81-62a5-403d-a648-0a6b38710f26) from the VRChat client, and notice the anime character.\n\n2. After reporting this world page to contain objectionable content, I found this same world from Open Reports, and I noticed the photo is no longer an anime character but a rather empty looking world placeholder thumbnail.\n\n3. Navigate back to the world page of the same world, an anime character is displayed there.\n\n4. Navigate to the VRChat Home website, it's also an anime character there.\n\n5. Navigate to worlds tab in VRChat Client, if the avatar world appears in the \"Avatar Worlds\" category, an anime character is displayed there.\n\n```\n\n2026.01.05 18:41:52 Warning    -  [TextureManagement] Could not download image https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/image/file_8bdf7d42-9ea2-4282-8886-e0cb6eb25b54/1/256 - HTTP/1.1 404 Not Found\n\n{\"error\":{\"message\":\"The thumbnail for that image is not available\",\"status_code\":404}}\n\n2026.01.05 18:41:52 Warning    -  [TextureManagement] Could not download image https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/image/file_2f1afc19-9856-4c16-bdb6-c67f00822ab0/1/256 - HTTP/1.1 404 Not Found\n\n{\"error\":{\"message\":\"The thumbnail for that image is not available\",\"status_code\":404}}\n\n2026.01.05 18:41:54 Warning    -  [TextureManagement] Could not download image https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/image/file_15d8f78d-07f0-4ac7-8173-4e13b9dd20d9/1/256 - HTTP/1.1 404 Not Found\n\n{\"error\":{\"message\":\"The thumbnail for that image is not available\",\"status_code\":404}}\n\n2026.01.05 18:46:32 Warning    -  [TextureManagement] Could not download image https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/image/file_15d8f78d-07f0-4ac7-8173-4e13b9dd20d9/1/256 - HTTP/1.1 404 Not Found\n\n{\"error\":{\"message\":\"The thumbnail for that image is not available\",\"status_code\":404}}\n\n```",
